  "description": "\"Do you wish for your own Deletion?\" \n\nA chance to live a second life, on the brink of despair. \n\nWithin its seemingly crumbling walls, the lavishly equipped Golden Lotus Bathhouse now houses 5 individuals dreaming of starting over. \n\nHowever, as the days go by, their suspicions grow. \n\nWhat are the secrets behind the Golden Lotus Bathhouse, which seems like a facility to help prepare for their new lives? Will the residents be able to truly delete their pasts and start their lives anew?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
